      "id": "claim_d75e25a75afe40c6972353ec9b1b2af2",
      "statement": "Codependix builds dependency graphs at three independent levels: Nx projects (codependix-nx-projects), NestJS modules (codependix-nestjs-modules), and file imports (codependix-file-imports for TypeScript and Python).",
