      "id": "claim_64900c393f9b41cbbf449a3723533d71",
      "statement": "The CLI provides two independent check modes: --check boundaries (gates boundary violations, runs on every PR) and --check reports (gates stale exports, runs on default branch), mirroring callidescope's depth/reports split.",
