      "statement": "The root codependix.config.ts exports projectDefaults (per-project anchor config), boundaries (all rules for three levels), include: [\"**\"] (all projects participate in workspace graphs and boundary checking), nestjsModules.rootModules (application root module mapping), and workspace (workspace-level export config).",
